{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "52f5980e0d1e894efaa89d5295f81937669041418c90eeff616d557714440132", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。\nサンドイッチを食べませんか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您辛苦了～。\n要吃三明治吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9f5423045d5980ab5837902e0914dda8f060e43f045fb5e981387c49e6032526", "ja": "お疲れさま、美也。\nサンドイッチって、急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，美也。\n怎么突然说起三明治了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "c4df39068e13c1bace47c07ab00139de5359b87a5a89de91e4d5195568bfd948", "ja": "はい～。この前、劇場のみんなと\nピクニックに行ったんですよ～。", "zh": "是的～前段时间，我和剧场的大家一起去野餐了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "ebe4e5f75ae5d57091e1e3b5fbd41ec996e5b1dc6bee2a313606df4bd75496bc", "ja": "今日のお弁当にサンドイッチを作っていたら、\nその時のことを思い出したんです～。", "zh": "今天做便当时做了三明治，\n就想起那时候的事了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "ad56c73ea531b9a40b8178bcd1f1ab21f28d00b769b8f82eb9d81f0dab0388e8", "ja": "そうしたらピクニックの気分になってしまって、\nたくさん作ってしまったので。おすそわけです～。", "zh": "于是就有了去野餐的心情，一不小心做了好多。这些分给你一些～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3020ba924d03174dcde8e9f628ee2db25411ef71461c736e5446b2231e61bdae", "ja": "その話なら、聞いたよ。美也が中心になって、\nみんなを誘ったんだってな？", "zh": "说到那件事，我听说了。听说是美也带头邀请了大家，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "1c236e0f806c27fbbfb17e118b5afcf51256675d9edf581b58ce8037373eb622", "ja": "そうなんです～。一緒に行ったのは、千早さんと\n真さん、まつりちゃんと紗代子ちゃんですよ～。", "zh": "是这样的～。和我一起去的是千早、真、茉莉和纱代子哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "22f56b63abc9a50787922798b7d7db8c8169b14319b3d01aba656df37621afce", "ja": "みんなで海に行ったんですけど、\n飾りつけもバッチリでしたよ～。むふふ。", "zh": "我们一起去海边了，\n装饰也准备得相当完美哦～。呜呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6dd024f06cfdfe41fe0a97d190cda0b2c240d6c4459f4ffc950d57d4e86f5bd2", "ja": "飾りつけ？　ピクニックに？", "zh": "装饰？野餐也要装饰吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "e061fefa89a9694b30140bb559117dfe9635d7f515e808d2a9f9f1ab9dcab1ad", "ja": "はい～。風船に、みんなの似顔絵を描いて\n飾りましたよ～。とっても楽しかったですよ～。", "zh": "是的～我在气球上画了大家的肖像，然后装饰起来了～特别开心哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "bdec9d4115f79d3ca41d2ed55e2f8c18ccc7f31a191094ac77de1773728fc3ae", "ja": "今度は{$P$}さんの顔も、\n描いてあげますね～。", "zh": "下次也给{$P$}先生画肖像哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dec34339cdc1acc8639a0e59574538b36e37aa22e090898e43f44b145a36afa4", "ja": "そ、そうか。けど、海か……仕事がなければ、\n俺もみんなとピクニックに行きたかったな。", "zh": "这、这样啊。不过，大海吗……要是没工作，我也想和大家一起去野餐啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "4216f44db2ef3339a68aec780de4783ad6c2d02738740977d8af87bc0196354f", "ja": "そうですね～。{$P$}さんは\nいつも忙しそうですし……。", "zh": "是啊～。{$P$}先生看起来总是很忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "714f1bf327f1c2b1735be25620c7eddbecdf1ba194933227224907a7fa0b3f67", "ja": "お～、いいアイディアが浮かびましたよ～！\n今から、事務室の飾りつけをしましょう～。", "zh": "哦～我想到一个好主意了～！\n我们现在就来装饰办公室吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b344a544326cd1ab793dcd05669a2469e1621f541e21a9c0655f268b03ff6614", "ja": "え、事務室を？", "zh": "诶，要装饰办公室吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "a0cc1232c4eb5e47bee15b7f66f029681bec9d1faf822b102960e1ef445c983e", "ja": "はい～。サンドイッチは、たくさんありますし。あとは\n飾りつけと、みんながいればバッチリですよ～。", "zh": "是的～三明治有很多。接下来只要再布置一下，大家也都到齐的话，就万事俱备啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "fb8287c9129b79e71f7fedafe06115e2a5632b778f7bec9cf131838e2d5029ef", "ja": "私、千早さんと真さんと、まつりちゃんと\n紗代子ちゃんを探してきますね～。", "zh": "我去找一下千早、真、小祭还有纱代子她们哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "2abbb88e25386d31ad4f8518f0f0ab32fd515bf1cbfb915d7557baee65dd1765", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nちょっとだけ待っていてくださいね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n请您稍微等一下哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ccb52dfe9b8e2682672e2e06c9d33ef1e3d9a5659955208085a79223097049d9", "ja": "あっ、美也……行っちゃったか。\nそれじゃ、少し周りを片付けるか……。", "zh": "啊，美也……已经走掉了啊。\n那我就稍微收拾一下周围吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0163_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7bea692aeb941a85f5cfaf3a7c8945ceab0df4e5494fb12ff157865dd5680f83", "ja": "（その後、劇場にいたみんなと一緒にサンドイッチを\n食べた。美也のお陰で、いいピクニックになったな！）", "zh": "（之后，我和剧场里的大家一起吃了三明治。多亏了美也，真是一次愉快的野餐啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
